# Resource bring-up order

Reference resource outputs so Terraform can infer dependencies. Create environments,
identity providers, teams, roles and runtime credentials first; then provider keys,
knowledge bases, MCP catalog entries and installations; then agents and gateways.
Add tool assignments, delegations, direct permission policies, projects and paused
schedule triggers. Each schedule requires a project. Protect sensitive state and
inspect plans before clearing authoritative grants.

Read the [v3 migration guide](https://github.com/archestra-ai/terraform-provider-archestra/blob/main/MIGRATION-v3.md)
before upgrading an existing Terraform workspace or Crossplane installation.
